      "title": "Show HN: Aircad – Professional drafting and 3D modeling in the browser",
      "url": "https://aircad.com",
      "author": "peetle",
      "external_id": "50441350",
      "summary": null,
      "why_read": null,
      "authors": [],
      "category": null,
      "published": "2026-11-10T15:01:19Z",
      "score": 74,
      "comments": 35,
      "hn_url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50441350",
      "snippet": "Aircad is a professional CAD system running in the browser with deep AI integration. It includes professional grade drafting and documentation tools, NURBS-based solid modeling, and a lot more. You can make professional quality design documents with it. It is all integrated behind a scripting API that can do anything you can do in the interface and also perform complex modeling operations efficiently. It reads and writes file formats like DXF, DWG, STEP, and 3DM.<p>I built Aircad because I was frustrated with what was out there. Current CAD tools are expensive and slow to improve. New features barely move the needle. With Aircad, you have fast, powerful geometry tools for just about anything, from conceptual models to your final design.<p>The newer generation of web-based CAD isn’t comprehensive enough to complete a project or is slower than existing desktop products because it sends per",
